## Completion fixture — word-start completion suggests visible
## top-level function names matching the typed prefix. The test
## locates the cursor by anchor identifier in the function body
## below and puts the cursor one byte in (just past the leading
## letter) to simulate the user mid-typing.

def greet
  puts "hi"
end

def goodbye
  puts "bye"
end

def main
  g_anchor_unique_xyz
end
